# Darwin counterpart of android_mobile_intrinsics_aarch64.S
# __cheng_orc_diag_dump_stack: program_support_backend's release-failure probe
# imports this C symbol unconditionally, so every Mach-O system link needs a
# definition. Android keeps its debuggerd raw-stack dumper; Darwin only needs
# the call to be linkable on the path that aborts right after.
